ginalCharacterName":"能代 薫衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"93"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"168"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl with a kind and somewhat sloppy personality who attends ordinary department, she always cuts classes and avoids involving herself with people for some reason. She is in a close relationship with Kana who always takes care of her."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"The reason for her strange behavior is because she was abducted by bad people during her childhood and got bad reputation since then which makes her afraid of getting attention."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87790"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"不真面目というわけではないが、とある理由からあまり人には関わろうとはしない普通科に通う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人だかりが特に苦手で、壱砂が受け持つ生徒数が多い選択式の授業に顔を出すことはない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分にお節介をしてくる四条香菜という女の子が気になっていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22865","sourceWorkId":"29018","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"不真面目というわけではないが、とある理由からあまり人には関わろうとはしない普通科に通う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人だかりが特に苦手で、壱砂が受け持つ生徒数が多い選択式の授業に顔を出すことはない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分にお節介をしてくる四条香菜という女の子が気になっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「香菜は真面目すぎるわね。もっと肩の力を抜いたら？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91707"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d1de6a7d3b1f1ca462fa184d57ca00db34b7e86550b51a81f585f5d1fd37cd8a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c781c3c0d7d21a6719188e4a3d9b6604aa1cc37218a09fbc10cf37789da10c24.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:301841:91707:16462:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87791","characterName":"甘黒 公子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"91705","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"301841"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22867"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87791"},"originalCharacterName":"甘黒 公子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"157"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A quiet and timid girl who attends ordinary department. Due to her dark personality and passive attitude, she doesn't have any friends. Therefore she admires and holds good will for Raimu who is the completely opposite of her."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is actually a masochist and has a bad relationship with her step-father who is also the cause of her androphobia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87791"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超が付く人見知りでコミュ障ながら、さらに面倒くさがりなため友人の少ない普通科に通う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親の再婚相手である男性と折り合いが悪く、それにより男性恐怖症になってしまっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だからこそ、人前で猫を被っている乙姫來夢に憧れ、そして気になっていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22867","sourceWorkId":"29018","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超が付く人見知りでコミュ障ながら、さらに面倒くさがりなため友人の少ない普通科に通う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親の再婚相手である男性と折り合いが悪く、それにより男性恐怖症になってしまっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だからこそ、人前で猫を被っている乙姫來夢に憧れ、そして気になっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お、乙姫さんには、その……仲良くしてもらってる、というか……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91705"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/349f8f883f65a20f3cb1aa60eeb4330b9484f2b3c089d09d191410954aa62d5b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a0f4b3723bf2aa5d426f54c50b25d9f50fb1a574c93f21df42eef1cd9a439509.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白砂菓夏海","creatorId":"vndb:s24677","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24677","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24677","name":"白砂菓 夏海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:301841:91705:52324:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87792","characterName":"乙姫 來夢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"91706","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"301841"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22866"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87792"},"originalCharacterName":"乙姫 來夢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"95"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"91"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A gyaru-type girl with a bright and friendly personality on the outside. Her true nature is very emotional which is shown by acting shy to her favorite person but becoming abusive otherwise. Because of her wealthy parents' influence, she always acts arrogant toward main character. Somehow, she is interested in Kimiko the outcast."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is the mastermind in trapping the main character in order to threaten him only to get blackmailed instead."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87792"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"親が学園関係者で有識者ということもあり、恰好やら言動に口をだされることがない進学科に通う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本は猫を被ってキャピキャピした態度を見せてくるが、その本性を曝け出すと激情家となり口汚くもなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分のことを理解しようとしてくる甘黒公子という女の子が気になっていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22866","sourceWorkId":"29018","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"親が学園関係者で有識者ということもあり、恰好やら言動に口をだされることがない進学科に通う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本は猫を被ってキャピキャピした態度を見せてくるが、その本性を曝け出すと激情家となり口汚くもなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分のことを理解しようとしてくる甘黒公子という女の子が気になっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「そ。公子ちゃんにはぁ～、らいむのきせかえ人形になってもらうの」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91706"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/aed956c62678255a3263eb7896c202c903e6797b1e4e68956e7f05d007f49755.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbb9bd31eb4d2f5cf8912cb54737928f49a2bdf708937bcf1a69a70a0e5e5a27.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"灰音","creatorId":"vndb:s14443","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14443","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14443","name":"灰音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83642","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87793","characterName":"四条 香菜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"91708","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"301841"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22864"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87793"},"originalCharacterName":"四条 香菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A role model of an ojousama who is kind, smart, serious, and relied on by everyone around. She was raised as a hothouse flower by her mother and grandmother, who taught her that men are just filthy and cruel. This twisted her mind against men. She is especially close to Kunoe whom she looks up to as older sister."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Despite her hatred of men, she tries to be kind to the main character in order to take advantage of him as an excellent teacher. This reminds him of his fiance who also used him the same way and with the help of aroma he rapes her as his first victim."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87793"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"お上品で、しかし身長が低いことにコンプレックスがある進学科に通う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"片親ながら、資産家の孫ということもあり蝶よ花よと育てられたがその母親と祖父母から「男は卑怯で汚らわしいもの」と言われ続け、本人もそう思うようになっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな香菜は、妙に放っておけないと能代薫衣という女の子が気になっていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22864","sourceWorkId":"29018","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"お上品で、しかし身長が低いことにコンプレックスがある進学科に通う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"片親ながら、資産家の孫ということもあり蝶よ花よと育てられたが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その母親と祖父母から「男は卑怯で汚らわしいもの」と言われ続け、本人もそう思うようになっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな香菜は、妙に放っておけないと能代薫衣という女の子が気になっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「薫衣さんは、頭も良くて、わたしの知らないことも、沢山知っているんですから」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91708"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd29127f99d43cd4ac75c5a16468cd1c441687783418bf6100cc121414abc24b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/character